		(rev "D")
		(company "Ed Weaver")
		(comment 1 "This design allows for multiple assembly variants to change the behavior of the LED.  The")
		(comment 2 "  design will drive all 3 colors of the multi-color LED to either blink or stay solidly lit.")
		(comment 3 "  The power source can be a dual input.  The main power input are two 3.0 volt coin cell")
		(comment 4 "  batteries in series.  The secondary power input is a USB-C receptacle that only")
		(comment 5 "  supplies power when the batteries are not installed.")
